  "text": "Araxxor Combat Achievements\n\n​\nIntroduction\nThis guide will go over how to complete the Master speed kill Combat achievement for Araxxor.\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Melee \n⬥ Necromancy \n\n​\nMelee Rotation \nPhase 1\nBurn web →   → ~20s   → ~35s  \nPhase 2\n~59s  +  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  → \nPhase 3\n +  →   →  if not dead\nPhase 4\n →  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  → target  +  →  →   → \n⬥ Notes:\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Can stall  to improve kill speed\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If using tc and not clicking  2t will need to be lost\nNecromancy Rotation \n⬥ As  Araxxor is desired for the Necromancy rotation, wearing a ranged weapon until Araxxor has spawned is required.\n​\nPhase 1\nAfter Araxxor has spawned, equip  + .\nApply  +  and build to 5  and 12  stacks. Do not attack the boss other than to apply the debuffs and obtain stacks.\nPhase 2\nAt 59 seconds use  +  +  →  +  +  →  +  + \nPhase 3\n +  +  →  →  \nPhase 4\n +  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  → Target  +  +  →  →  →  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nExample Kills\n⬥ 1:37.8 Melee \n⬥ 1:39.6 Necromancy \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Araxxor Combat Achievements ​ Introduction This guide will go over how to complete the Master speed kill Combat achievement for Araxxor. ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Melee ⬥ Necromancy ​ Melee Rotation Phase 1 Burn web → → ~20s → ~35s Phase 2 ~59s + → → → → → → → → Phase 3 + → → if not dead Phase 4 → → → → → → → → → target + → → → ⬥ Notes: ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Can stall to improve kill speed ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If using tc and not clicking 2t will need to be lost Necromancy Rotation ⬥ As Araxxor is desired for the Necromancy rotation, wearing a ranged weapon until Araxxor has spawned is required. ​ Phase 1 After Araxxor has spawned, equip + . Apply + and build to 5 and 12 stacks. Do not attack the boss other than to apply the debuffs and obtain stacks. Phase 2 At 59 seconds use + + → + + → + + Phase 3 + + → → Phase 4 + → → → → → → → → Target + + → → → Example Kills ⬥ 1:37.8 Melee ⬥ 1:39.6 Necromancy",
